  "content": [
    {
      "text": "glory is departed from Israel, 1 Sam. 4:21. crowned him with glory, Ps. 8:5 (Heb. 2:7). God is my salvation and my glory, Ps. 62:7. Lord will give grace and glory, Ps. 84:11. Let the saints be joyful in glory, Ps. 149:5. crown of glory shall she deliver, Prov. 4:9. glory of children are their fathers, Prov. 17:6. glory of young men is their strength, Prov. 20:29. for men to search their own glory is not glory, Prov. 25:27. earth is full of his glory, Isa. 6:3 (2 Ne. 16:3). my people have changed their glory, Jer. 2:11. him that glorieth glory in this, Jer. 9:24 (1 Cor. 1:31; 2 Cor. 10:17).",
